    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Estate Agents are delighted to present Apartment number 17 Granby Hall, a charming gem of a property . Number 17 is a dual aspect  apartment which is presented in excellent condition throughout  having been well maintained  by the current owner. This property is sure to appeal to buyers looking to set up home with the city centre  at your door step.\n\n\nThis ideal  location  offers O`Connell street  an abundance of shops,pubs, restaurants ,The Hugh Lane Gallery and The Garden of Remembrance are all close by.Excellent transport links including the Luas and Dublin Bus Q.B.C. are all convenient to the location.\n\n\nNumber 17 offers a bright  internal open plan design which allows an abundance of natural light throughout .In brief the accommodation comprises of;an entrance hall, an open plan kitchen/dining/living area, there is a double bedroom and family bathroom.\n\nService charge c. 2250 with Granby Hall property management company.\n\nViewing by appointment with DNG estate agents in Phibsboro 01 8300989\n\nLocal DNG agents: Brian McGee, Vincent Mullen, Isabel O`Neill, Michelle Keeley & Ciaran Jones, Leah Barry.MIPAV."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 1.86m x 3.9m\nHallway with laminate floor.There is access to the hotpress.\n\nKitchen/dining area - 4m x 4.13m\nOpen plan kitchen/dining area.There is semi-solid wooden flooring.Kitchen with floor and wall presses.There is good storage.\n\nBathroom - 2.79m x 1.78m\nFamily bathroom with stylish finish.There is a W/C, W.H.B and a bath with shower over.There is a window for light and ventilation.\n\nBedroom - 2.55m x 4.45m\nDouble bedroom with laminate floor.\n\n"
      },
      {
